{
  "tema": 5841,
  "slug": "oi-oyo-oyeron",
  "titulo": "Oír in the preterite",
  "subtitulo": "¿Oíste eso?",
  "foto": "t07.jpg",
  "regla": "Oír has regular endings in the preterite, but the i becomes y in él/ella/usted and ellos/ustedes, and the other forms carry an accent: oí, oíste, oyó, oímos, oyeron.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Oír** (_to hear_) uses the regular -ir endings in the preterite, with two spelling changes."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "In **él / ella / usted** and **ellos / ustedes**, the **i** becomes **y**: **oyó**, **oyeron**. An unstressed i between two vowels turns into y."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Oí**, **oíste** and **oímos** keep a **written accent** on the í, so it's pronounced as its own syllable."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "oír"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "oí"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "oíste"
            ],
            [
              "él / ella / usted",
              "oyó"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "oímos"
            ],
            [
              "ellos / ellas / ustedes",
              "oyeron"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Oímos** is both present and preterite. Context decides: **Ayer oímos un ruido**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: the **y** shows up where the endings start with a vowel, the same as **leyó** and **creyó**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "¿==Oíste== eso? Creo que alguien tocó la puerta.",
              "en": "Did you hear that? I think someone knocked on the door."
            },
            {
              "es": "Anoche ==oí== a los coyotes cerca de la casa.",
              "en": "Last night I heard the coyotes near the house."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi abuela no ==oyó== el teléfono.",
              "en": "My grandma didn't hear the phone."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Oímos== la noticia en la radio.",
              "en": "We heard the news on the radio."
            },
            {
              "es": "Los vecinos ==oyeron== la música hasta las tres de la mañana.",
              "en": "The neighbors heard the music until three in the morning."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Ustedes ==oyeron== los cohetes anoche?",
              "en": "Did you guys hear the fireworks last night?"
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Ya ==oíste== la nueva canción de tu banda favorita?",
              "en": "Have you heard your favorite band's new song yet?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
